{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想起从前亲近的日子，他一度真盼着还能那样相处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可那份亲近越鲜活，当初那些委屈也跟着翻上来：那一步走得对不对，后不后悔？没走的话，如今又会怎样？\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"只修改S04。三位独立读者都指出这一段的归属怀念与当初离开的理由扣得不够紧，意见成立。S04-1压缩表达，保留短暂盼望旧日相处继续的心理；S04-2把原来较泛的“这么盼着”换成亲近记忆越鲜活、当初委屈也随之涌现的递进，让怀念与维护尊严的理由在这一段的新变化中相遇。同时保留对离开是否正确、是否后悔以及假如没走会怎样的全部疑问。两条合计字数略减。S03、S05、S12各只有一位读者提出意见，未达到本轮至少两位读者共同指出才修改的门槛，因此不动。其他段落全部保持原样。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e5d6949f-eada-4665-8e62-d5cc067ddf19", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T161056874896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:12:35.198751+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8c5010f8012bbb51ac2a0aff241fac0c664595727326558b2530c8e2092ac1a5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_se